lay: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHvmX1LH0BPrI8spHImFib2ibMAZKic4TziaicfMhUVNFGjTE6deonVAiaSwvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最后，感谢我们的设计师小组的绞尽脑汁在这么紧凑的时间里把这套产品落地；感谢我们的生产烘焙组小伙伴们从原物料开始留仓管理到这么多锅次的零碎生产执行，到最终包装小能手们的各种楼道内的呼喊和奔跑～最终，2024的年终总结就这么画上了一个完满的句号；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我非常非常非常的满意和满足！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHU4LDIjibemoicphgnu4pkzDDmO9qhlKSLkdFQeIEkBXLruz0JJDXxtLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgH9z1NXahmvlccAkic3eq1461sjsaxF4RjkyXmQ8WJUtEwJ9CiasiaFXpCg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHneWscMGdlLYEHBVkGHzKpMP0lBrY5FCOjcI0nNCuRrzXKibbNvPPiahA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHxJkb3sAumyZKTSVHIDhiacib5zkOuweFWo996FzDLC8TNEUvtMasuWsg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHjzXmlicf1FRbD7qR31OfMuiaUh0Qr7gjyB58bmeicaemqMzRuTFia1Fe4A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q9ewX59FKPOtrfvTjsQSgHeWYS7qO2SDTkn2vVSNoX9uG4CHGv9XM8bbcdCPC0kqd4vGoqP0yIMg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          2025的产季报告，俺已经在努力炼制中了～哈哈哈哈！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          即将上新的单品豆子：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥斯达黎加 库瓦 瑰夏 水洗/黄蜜处理/厌氧日晒 3种处理方式\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            秘鲁 绮丽洛玛 瑰夏 水洗 2023产季（试试一只旧产季的豆子）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            秘鲁 香韵 瑰夏 水洗\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            墨西哥 布鲁湖 波旁/铁皮卡/新世界 水洗\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴拿马 哈特曼 瑰夏 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴拿马 骡子 瑰夏 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            厄瓜多尔 若干\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          即将上新的拼配：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            开门红\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://e.tb.cn/h.TRISlHeyyWg6cLf?tk=rLYKe1TjW1V\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" tab=\"outerlink\" ta